ompletely up to you: concentrate on studies, get friends and stay in good physical and mental state. Or explore the old rumours, read the forbidden books at Miskatonic University, and work on your occult thesis. Or just stay in bed, and hope that it all goes away!  <br><br>Based on the short story &quot;The Dreams in the Witch House&quot; by H.P. Lovecraft.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902850/extras/2670d518f497b58750e083bf6cc414b7.webp?t=1781546316\" width=135 height=32 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Open world sandbox meets point and click adventure game<br></li><li>RPG elements: money, health, sanity, and many character stats<br></li><li>Day / evening / night - cycles and changing weather<br></li><li>Several endings depending on player’s actions <br></li><li>10 - 20 hours of playtime<br></li><li>Original soundtrack by genre favourite Troy Sterling Nies (<i>The Call of Cthulhu</i>, <i>The Whisperer in the Darkness</i>) <br></li><li>Creeping tension: otherwordly threats intensify gradually <br></li><li>320 x 180 pixel graphics <br></li><li>Plenty of detailed animation and visual effects</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902850/extras/23f707fcfaa4679537e1d7a20e0f4a7d.poster.avif?t=1781546316\" width=640 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902850/extras/23f707fcfaa4679537e1d7a20e0f4a7d.webm?t=1781546316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1902850/extras/23f707fcfaa4679537e1d7a20e0f4a7d.mp4?t=1781546316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>", "short_description": "Navigate the eerie world of Dreams in the Witch House, a unique blend of point-and-click and RPG-adventure. Unravel occult mysterie